the ending.\n\n{1292510498519654}\n\nFinally\nThis title includes an auto-save system that records your progress automatically.  \n However, please note that there is no option to reset your data.\n\nJust like your real-life youth was a once-in-a-lifetime experience, the youth you live through in this game is also unique and fleeting.   \nCherish each moment and enjoy the present to the fullest.\n", "short_description": "\"SchoolFriendMemories Vol.2\" is a romance adventure game where you can experience the youthful days of high school, centering around everyday conversations with Akari Akesaka, a senior aiming for art school.\n\nAs the protagonist, you will relive the process of gradually deepening your bond with the heroine through daily interactions.\n\nEnjoy a moment of youth in a VR space that brings the school atmosphere to life."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "sozai1.png", "id": "2356403878065960", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392301_2356403881399293_5160666627903576270_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I8QVpTqcEf0Q7kNvwGWzOBV&_nc_oc=AdqTKCOLX8v1bEZ30Zh7xVVzY-BtdM2uYbZKuinmGfWePtTUuqj8IJb9zmhkdNiR40Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQzi7BDTpm11i3Qd2TFC932oc1j8cEToV-4CjPV6kA4HA&oe=6B084E70"}, {"file_name": "sozai5.png", "id": "1862155974567007", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392127_1862155981233673_6629870527784498539_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0p56oVmllpsQ7kNvwFSMB8L&_nc_oc=Adr7rtEXRjxr1aYxqts7UZvxImX-zeBEEPDCRrUP877XEwuWpxrsOPHaB0C06_sbqrw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT7sr8qPOHpOfikIoQrO9GzLSvAmkDUUa_fGeF00QNnFQ&oe=6B086967"}, {"file_name": "sozai2.png", "id": "1198978045112343", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-d